      "id": "phrase-por-aquí",
      "kind": "phrase",
      "promptEs": "por aquí",
      "questionEn": "How do you point out something nearby as “around here,” “over here,” or “this way”?",
      "answerEn": "Use por aquí.",
      "noteEn": "The exact English wording changes with the situation. A guide can use por aquí while indicating an area or leading someone in a direction.",
      "example": {
        "es": "La salida está por aquí.",
        "en": "The exit is around here."
